# Component Creation Pattern

This document defines the preferred pattern for creating React components in this project.

## Pattern

interface ComponentProps {}
```typescript
const ComponentName = (props: ComponentProps) => {
  const { prop } = props;
  
  return (
    // Component JSX
  );
};
```

## Example

interface ButtonProps {}
```typescript
const Button = (props: ButtonProps) => {
  const { children, variant } = props;
  
  return (
    <button className={variant}>
      {children}
    </button>
  );
};
```

## Rules
- Use arrow function syntax
- Destructure props at the start of the component
- Use TypeScript for props typing
- Follow PascalCase naming convention